{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey down the rabbit hole into a Wonderland like you've never seen before~. Embark on a TwIsTeD retelling of the classic fairy tale &quot;Alice in Wonderland&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520770/extras/banner.png?t=1746457524\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Alice in this visual novel experience as you both try to survive this hellscape and unravel the mystery of who you are and what happened to the citizens of Wonderland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a colorful cast of characters while embarking through the woods!! You never know who is truly on your side. Maybe everyone or no one at all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a long journey to the Hearts Palace... Can you survive long enough???</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520770?t=1746457524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520770?t=1746457524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520770/5719d89a706b7a9b8c57bdf229dcb90560031eb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746457524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520770/5719d89a706b7a9b8c57bdf229dcb90560031eb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746457524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey down the rabbit hole into a Wonderland like you've never seen before~. Embark on a TwIsTeD retelling of the classic fairy tale &quot;Alice in Wonderland&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a